---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <title>Hiring help | Share a Trade</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Practical notes for Spokane-area homeowners hiring a contractor—especially after a fire or storm. Not legal or insurance advice."
    />
  </Fragment>

  <article class="how-it-works">
    <h1>Hiring help</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Short orientation for homeowners comparing contractors—especially after a
      fire or storm. This is not legal, insurance, or financial advice. Confirm
      everything with your insurer, adjuster, and the contractor you hire.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>Before work starts</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Photograph damage, rooms, and serial numbers on equipment.</li>
        <li>Save emails, estimates, and a simple timeline of who you talked to.</li>
        <li>Ask for written scope: what’s included, what’s not, and who pulls permits.</li>
        <li>Get more than one bid on the same scope so numbers are comparable.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Questions worth asking</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Are you licensed and insured for this work in this state?</li>
        <li>Will you bill me, or bill the insurer directly?</li>
        <li>What’s the down payment, and when is the rest due?</li>
        <li>Who is on site, and who do I call if something changes?</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Common red flags</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Cash-only, no written estimate, or pressure to sign today.</li>
        <li>No license number, or a license you can’t verify.</li>
        <li>A huge upfront payment before materials or permits.</li>
        <li>Asking you to skip the adjuster or inflate the claim.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Official places to check</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.insurance.wa.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"
            >Washington Office of the Insurance Commissioner</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://doi.idaho.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"
            >Idaho Department of Insurance</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://secure.lni.wa.gov/verify/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer">Verify a WA contractor license (L&amp;I)</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.fema.gov/assistance" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"
            >FEMA assistance</a
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>When you’re ready to call someone</h2>
      <p>
        The directory is free. Filter by trade, save a few names, and share a
        listing with a neighbor if you want a second set of eyes.
      </p>
    </section>

    <p class="how-actions">
      <a class="button button-primary" href="/">Browse contractors</a>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="/how-it-works">How it works</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
